# Day 12 – Job Search & Personal Branding Toolkit

## Objective

Built a complete AI-powered job search and personal branding toolkit.

## Generated Assets

- ATS-Friendly Cover Letter
- Recruiter Outreach Email
- Hiring Manager Email
- LinkedIn Connection Request
- Referral Request Message
- Follow-Up Email
- Interview Introduction
- Job Titles Recommendation
- Skill Gap Analysis
- Personal Brand Summary

## Key Learnings

- Resume alone is not enough.
- Personal branding improves recruiter visibility.
- Networking messages increase response rates.
- ATS optimization helps resume screening.
- Skill gap analysis helps create learning roadmap.

## Outcome

Created a complete career toolkit for internships and future job opportunities.
